State IDLE as "待機" color "#4F46E5":
    開始を待つ状態

State RUNNING as "実行中" color "#22C55E":
    実行している状態

State FAILED as "失敗" color "#FF0000":
    開始に失敗した状態

EventCategoryHeaders "系統" > "区分" > "種別"
Event START as "開始" in "操作" > "運転" > "開始系"
Event STOP as "停止" in "操作" > "運転"
Event PING as "疎通確認"

Transition IDLE on START:
    Common:
        要求を記録する
    Branch "準備完了" -> RUNNING:
        開始する
    Branch "それ以外" -> FAILED:
        -

Transition RUNNING on STOP -> IDLE:
    -

Transition IDLE on PING -> -:
    応答する
